+// ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
+// THE PULL REQUEST QUOTES THE FOLD SUITE'S FAILING BLOCK
+//
+// A THIRD numbering, belonging to a third task (#763 narrowed to part (2), on
+// top of #715's `suite red` section). Its clauses are M1–M5 and its legs (a)–(e)
